KiCad KRT Gloss contains the dgloss work initially developed against KiCad
Routing Tools and consumes KiCad Routing Tools as a Git submodule and packaged
runtime dependency. It preserves the copyright and primary code provenance of
DrAndyHaas. KiCad Routing Tools is Copyright (c) 2026 drandyhaas and is
distributed under the MIT License found in KRT/LICENSE.

Frantz is the author and maintainer of the standalone adaptation, developed
with assistance from ChatGPT/Codex (OpenAI).

The Track Gloss icon was recovered from the earlier kicad_gloss experimental
plugin solely as a user-interface asset. No algorithm from that project is
used by kicad_krt_gloss.
